MODULE: ReadyHistoryTornRead
TARGET: HistoryReadAtomic
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: A public history read returns only one revision from an atomic two-key batch
PERTURBS: Observe

--- FIND
    /\ historySnapshots' = [historySnapshots EXCEPT ![c] = history[c]]
--- REPLACE
    /\ historySnapshots' = [historySnapshots EXCEPT ![c] = {r \in history[c] : r[1] = r[2]}]
--- END
